cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "LOD-AM pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Data pipeline of LOD-AM (Linked Open Data for Ancient Metallurgy): turns a
  snapshot of the research database into RDF (R2RML with Ontop), enriches and
  checks it against the LOD-AM data model, and packages the publications the
  owner released as data releases with a manifest.
authors:
